    "number": 86,
    "summary": "1–7, The Lord gives the meaning of the parable of the wheat and tares; 8–11, He explains priesthood blessings to those who are lawful heirs according to the flesh.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [
      {
        "type": "introduction",
        "text": "Revelation given through Joseph Smith the Prophet, at Kirtland, Ohio, December 6, 1832. This revelation was received while the Prophet was reviewing and editing the manuscript of the translation of the Bible."
      }
    ],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "Verily, thus saith the Lord unto you my servants, concerning the parable of the wheat and of the tares:",
