        "reference": "Doctrine and Covenants 86:1",
        "book": "Doctrine and Covenants",
        "chapter": 86,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold, verily I say, the field was the world, and the apostles were the sowers of the seed;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
